GGF Recast -- internal development preview
Original application code prepared for Get Going Fast, 2026.

This task delivers the application and its source to Get Going Fast for local
development and testing. A public release license for GGF's original application
code has not been selected or published by this task.

Embedded third-party components retain their licenses and notices. The ComfyUI
inference components carry GPLv3 terms in vendor/comfy_core/LICENSE. The Viggle
adapter carries Apache-2.0 code terms in vendor/viggle_remake/LICENSE-CODE.
Model weights have separate licenses. See MODEL-TERMS.txt.
Any future distribution must account for the terms of the combined package.
